175
00:18:25.409 --> 00:18:28.599
John Talburt: make it his own. That's what consultants do.

176
00:18:29.599 --> 00:18:35.679
John Talburt: And he was a big advocate and promoter of Schuhart's statistical process control.

177
00:18:36.439 --> 00:18:41.629
John Talburt: And, then, again.

178
00:18:41.899 --> 00:18:49.449
John Talburt: The importance of process thinking, thinking about things in terms of the process that's used to create something.

179
00:18:49.819 --> 00:19:02.089
John Talburt: So this is some of the important points of dimming, and again, it's quite famous. There's several… there's still a dimming society, and they still give awards for…

