604
01:08:55.509 --> 01:08:59.129
John Talburt: It's a very, very powerful, consulting tool.

605
01:08:59.769 --> 01:09:07.379
John Talburt: And, this is the 10 steps, and again, it's not…

606
01:09:07.549 --> 01:09:12.349
John Talburt: totally linear. There are some places where you have

607
01:09:12.629 --> 01:09:16.379
John Talburt: Multiple paths, and then a cross-cutting.

608
01:09:16.509 --> 01:09:19.309
John Talburt: There's communication, actions, and results.

