01:09:29.619 --> 01:09:32.299
John Talburt: As a data quality practitioner.

612
01:09:32.729 --> 01:09:40.509
John Talburt: And she has some very important books. The one that we have used in the past, Measuring Data Quality for Ongoing Improvement.

